acceptance_criteria: Two real training generations produce changed checkpoints and collect with the promoted successor; a bounded LLM adapter demonstrates parameter updates; two controllers launch a job once; crash and cancellation drills preserve artifacts and budget integrity; contamination and invalid checkpoints stop promotion; every authored source passes exact four-metric coverage and documented-surface gates
